/v1/","context":{"app_id":4124290,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4124290-1846651706691357","game_id":"steam-4124290","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is here — Come die with us! 💀","summary":"In this puzzle-platformer, dying isn't a failure — it's the goal!Solve increasingly tricky puzzles by figuring out how to sacrifice all of your characters in the right order and under the right conditions.What can you expect from the demo?Single-player Story mode — Witness the beginning of the story of Demigod Islands and solve the first 9 puzzle rooms + 1 secret room.2-Player Online Co-op mode — Team up with a friend, solve puzzles in separate rooms, and communicate to coordinate your deaths.Un","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691357","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:56:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4124290-1846018067938920","game_id":"steam-4124290","kind":"announcement","title":"Die Together! Online 2-Player Co-op Is Here","summary":"Hi everyone!I'm excited to announce that the new demo for Demigod Islands: A Puzzle to Die For is now available on Steam, featuring an entirely new way to play — two-player online co-op!Two players. Separate rooms. One deadly goal.In the new co-op mode, you and your friend are trapped in separate puzzle rooms. You can't see what the other player sees, so you'll need to communicate, coordinate your actions, and figure out how to solve each puzzle together.And since this is Demigod Islands, solvin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T17:09:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938920","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:56:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4124290-1833334318580069","game_id":"steam-4124290","kind":"announcement","title":"Updated Demo Now Live","summary":"Hi everyone!I’ve just uploaded an updated version of the demo for Demigod Islands: A Puzzle to Die For.Demigod Islands is a 2D puzzle-platformer where the usual goal is turned upside down: instead of avoiding danger, your job is to figure out how to sacrifice all of your characters in each puzzle room.This update focuses on making the demo clearer, smoother, and more polished.Here are the main changes:Added unique comic-style windows for each deathAdded progress tracking to the pause menu, so yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T18:07:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318580069","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:56:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4124290-1827626365754741","game_id":"steam-4124290","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Out Now","summary":"Demigod Islands: A Puzzle to Die For is a 2D puzzle-platformer which flips dying in video games on its head. In this game, your job in each puzzle room is to sacrifice all of your characters.That means that enemies, spikes and lasers which would be obstacles in most of games, can be used as tools here to achieve your goal.In the demo, you will explore parts of two islands and go through 9 puzzle rooms to reach the end. There is also one special secret puzzle room, if you're looking for that extr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-19T17:25:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365754741","verified_at":"2026-10-20T1